cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evidence, cite this versioned record."
title: "Human Activity Classification Under Domain and Temporal Shift"
type: software
version: "3.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Huseyinli
    given-names: Abdulla
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdullahuseyinli-dot/human-activity-classification"
url: "https://github.com/abdullahuseyinli-dot/human-activity-classification"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A leakage-audited human activity classification study spanning POLAR, V-COCO,
  and Okutama-Action. This version includes source-overlap controls, person-level
  transfer, short-clip temporal modeling, budgeted inference, paired uncertainty,
  attribution diagnostics, bounded fault injection, and a recording-grouped
  camera-compensated part-trajectory residual architecture study.
keywords:
  - human activity recognition
  - transfer learning
  - DINOv2
  - DINOv3
  - ConvNeXt
  - POLAR
  - V-COCO
  - Okutama-Action
  - domain adaptation
  - calibration
  - evaluation methodology
  - temporal modeling
  - motion identifiability
